From e7440a403bd3b58ccaf6b7a6565a0fa365b6c4f9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: build <you@example.com>
Date: Sun, 12 Jul 2026 01:00:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] dedup: remove duplicate shape entries from tuned GEMM/MoE CSV
 configs

aiter/jit/core.py auto-detects duplicate (gfx,M,N,K) shape entries when
multiple per-model CSV files are merged. These duplicates arise when patches
0001-0005 add model-specific configs that overlap with existing ones.

Auto-resolved by keeping the row with the lowest measured latency (us).
